From 8a81cfe5052efdce6f118a6d9b1f80bbee88cc30 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CNC Crafts UI Refresh <cnc-crafts-studio@example.com>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 14:07:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: My Orders flow, admin polish, real logo + fix
 Tailwind reset bug
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Track Order → My Orders
- Remove manual order-id/email inputs
- Logged-out state shows a sign-in card with a single Sign-In CTA
- Logged-in state fetches GET /api/orders/mine?email=… and lists all
  orders as premium expandable cards with a 4-step progress tracker,
  item breakdown and delivery details
- Cancelled orders get a dedicated warning block

Admin
- Fix login: correct placeholder email admin@cnccrafts.in (was cnccraft.in
  missing an 's') both in login modal and sidebar footer
- Restore dashboard layout (KPI cards, sidebar icons, table) that broke
  because a global '*{margin:0;padding:0}' reset silently killed all
  Tailwind padding/margin utilities. Reset scoped to explicit elements
  instead.
- Add product image upload already wired (Cloudinary + local fallback)

Branding
- Use the supplied CNC oval logo across navbar, footer and favicon;
  cleaned image to remove the '20' from the left ESTD plaque as requested
- Add public/favicon.ico with multiple resolutions

Backend
- New GET /api/orders/mine?email=… endpoint returning a customer's
  orders sorted most-recent-first with parsed item arrays
